{"title":"Alex","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><i> 'Alex '</i> is an (adorable) hammerhead shark with four arms in <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Beast_Academy\" title=\"Beast Academy\">Beast Academy</a>. He is part of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Beast_Academy\" title=\"Beast Academy\">Beast Academy</a> math team. His penchant for organization keep the team in order. Later in the B5 books, he becomes a director and is a well-known character.\n</p><p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Alex&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018072529\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.006 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.010 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 7/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 253/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.234      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.234      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:27229:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018072529 and revision id 285496. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}